0016:     shape: winding corridor that meanders through most of the grid, spanning >=75% of rows and columns
0017:     width: N pixels
0018:     chokepoints: 0-3 narrow segments (width < N, length 1-6 pixels) that block the NxN square;
0019:       channel width changes (either taper or widen back to N) are gradual (max 1 pixel difference between adjacent cells)
0020:     no internal bg islands
0021:   transform:
0022:     BFS on NxN-placement graph from mover toward dest
0023:     if reachable — mover overwrites dest position, original mover position filled with river
0024:     if blocked — mover moves to farthest BFS-reachable position, dest unchanged, original mover position filled with river
0025:   outcome: ~50% reached (0 chokepoints), ~50% stuck (1-3 chokepoints, requires N >= 2)
